invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the configuration hash leaves out the hostname, so a ticket's binding
  names only the anchors and resumes under any hostname they share.
  The known-answer row and the other-hostname rows object.

--- old
    hash_len(&s, cfg->hostname_len);
    sha256_update(&s, lower, cfg->hostname_len);
--- new
    (void)lower;
